          <commentary>계산식과 일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>충돌 전 운동에너지의 20 %</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산식과 일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
